## Description
Slice 1 of the Third Eye World build: the Next.js 16 foundation, tooling, CI, and a health route. Every later slice builds on this. No product features yet.

## Changes
- Next.js 16 (App Router / RSC) + React 19 + TypeScript strict (`noUncheckedIndexedAccess`)
- Tailwind CSS 4 + base design tokens + accessibility primitives (skip link, `.sr-only`, global reduced-motion reset)
- ESLint (next config) + Prettier; Vitest (unit) + Playwright (e2e) wired
- `/api/health` liveness route
- GitHub Actions CI: type-check, lint, unit, build, e2e
- Runtime deps: motion, gsap, next-auth (v5), prisma, @node-rs/argon2, zod
- Clean, accessible holding page; removed Vercel-branded template assets
- `turbopack.root` pinned (fixes a stray `~/package-lock.json` workspace-root inference); standalone output gated to Docker builds

